li racconta la storia della sua infanzia. Di come lei, giovane ragazza ebrea nella Francia occupata dai nazisti, fu nascosta e protetta da un compagno di classe. Di come la sensibilità e il coraggio di questo ragazzo le abbiano salvato la vita. Di quanto può essere forte il potere della gentilezza, tale da cambiare il mondo."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"After being expelled from Beecher Prep for his treatment of a classmate with a facial deformity, Julian has struggled to fit in at his new school. To transform his life, Julian's grandmother finally reveals her own story of courage of her youth in Nazi-occupied France, where a classmate shelters her from mortal danger.","tagline":"One act of kindness lives on forever."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2WeMTBgrfVdG6BNLczp3LyBrkeA.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l7U8hKJsDL2DfYg7nYUACewg9d0.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":779816,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2WeMTBgrfVdG6BNLczp3LyBrkeA.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2WeMTBgrfVdG6BNLczp3LyBrkeA.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2WeMTBgrfVdG6BNLczp3LyBrkeA.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2WeMTBgrfVdG6BNLczp3LyBrkeA.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rxKWpNd6Ihnl2jtVERCHMXZ7MkK.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rxKWpNd6Ihnl2jtVERCHMXZ7MkK.jpg","language":"it","width":1920,"height":2806}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s2igE99PVBEMsry3qEGEH3rM83K.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s2igE99PVBEMs